k\" href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/JSTOR_(identifier)\" title=\"JSTOR (identifier)\" id=\"mwiQ\">JSTOR</a><span typeof=\"mw:Entity\" id=\"mwig\">&nbsp;</span><a rel=\"mw:ExtLink nofollow\" href=\"https://www.jstor.org/stable/1551378\" id=\"mwiw\">1551378</a>.</cite><span title=\"ctx_ver=Z39.88-2004&amp;rft_val_fmt=info%3Aofi%2Ffmt%3Akev%3Amtx%3Ajournal&amp;rft.genre=article&amp;rft.jtitle=Arctic+and+Alpine+Research&amp;rft.atitle=Ecology+and+Morphology+of+Globular+Mosses+of+Grimmia+longirostris+in+the+Paramo+de+Piedras+Blancas%2C+Venezuelan+Andes&amp;rft.volume=23&amp;rft.issue=2&amp;rft.pages=133-148&amp;rft.date=1991&amp;rft_id=info%3Adoi%2F10.2307%2F1551378&amp;rft_id=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.jstor.org%2Fstable%2F1551378%23id-name%3DJSTOR&amp;rft.aulast=Perez&amp;rft.aufirst=Francisco+L.&amp;rfr_id=info%3Asid%2Fen.wikipedia.org%3AGlacier+mice\" about=\"#mwt11\" id=\"mwjA\"></span></span></li>\n<li about=\"#cite_note-5\" id=\"cite_note-5\" data-mw-footnote-number=\"5\"><span id=\"mwjQ\"><a href=\"#cite_ref-5\" rel=\"mw:referencedBy\" id=\"mwjg\"><span id=\"mwjw\">↑</span></a></span> <span id=\"mw-reference-text-cite_note-5\"><cite id=\"CITEREFUetakeTanakaHaraTanabe2014\" about=\"#mwt14\">Uetake, Jun; Tanaka, Sota; Hara, Kosuke; Tanabe, Yukiko; Samyn, Denis; Motoyama, Hideaki; Imura, Satoshi; Kohshima, Shiro (17 November 2014). <a rel=\"mw:ExtLink nofollow\" href=\"https://www.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/pmc/articles/PMC4234412\" id=\"mwkQ\">\"Novel Biogenic Aggregation of Moss Gemmae on a Disappearing African Glacier\"</a>. <i id=\"mwkg\">PLOS ONE</i>. <b id=\"mwkw\">9</b> (11) e112510. <a rel=\"mw:WikiLink\" href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Bibcode_(identifier)\" title=\"Bibcode (identifier)\" id=\"mwlA\">Bibcode</a>:<a rel=\"mw:ExtLink nofollow\" href=\"https://ui.adsabs.harvard.edu/abs/2014PLoSO...9k2510U\" id=\"mwlQ\">2014PLoSO...9k2510U</a>. <a rel=\"mw:WikiLink\" href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Doi_(identifier)\" title=\"Doi (identifier)\" id=\"mwlg\">doi</a>:<